<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Héritage | Decor & Lifestyle</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/style.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Funnel+Display:wght@300&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
<body>

    <!-- @import "header" -->

     <main>

        <section class="banner">
            <figure class="hero-banner">
                <img src="src/assets/img/artpage-hero.png" alt="Interior Clássico Héritage" class="hero-img">
            </figure>
            <div class="hero-title">
                <h1>Decor and <span class="page-title">Lifestyle</span></h1>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- @import "featured" -->


        <section class="elegance">
    <figure><img src="src/assets/img/refined-living.png" alt="Carved green armchair in a red room"></figure>
      <div class="history">
        <h2>A LEGACY OF <span>REFINED</span> LIVING</h2>
          <p>Decorating with antiques is more than an aesthetic choice; it is a dialogue between eras. At Héritage, we curate pieces that transform spaces into personal galleries. From the soft glow of a Tiffany lamp to the commanding presence of a Georgian armchair, our collection is designed for those who seek to live among stories, blending historical soul with modern elegance.</p>
      </div>
  </section>

        <section class="room-showcase-container">
            <div class="room-header">
                <span class="shop-tag">shop the look</span>
                <h2>GEORGIAN ROOM</h2>
                <p>The Georgian era is defined by a sense of harmony, proportion, and understated luxury. This living room arrangement features classic wingback chairs in rich ochre velvet, set against deep-toned wood paneling and warm candlelight, evoke a timeless atmosphere of comfort and scholarly refinement.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="full-banner-armchair"></div>
            <div class="product-grid">
                <a href="productpage_1.html" class="product-link">
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/chair.png" alt="Georgian Chair">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Georgian Chair</h3>
                        <p class="price">€3,200</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>

                <a href="productpage_7.html" class="product-link">
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/table.png" alt="Pedestal Table">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Pedestal Table</h3>
                        <p class="price">€1,200</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>

                <a href="productpage_8.html" class="product-link">
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/chandelier.png" alt="Crystal Chandelier">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Crystal Chandelier</h3>
                        <p class="price">€5,800</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>

                <a href="productpage_4.html" class="product-link"> 
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/portrait.png" alt="Classical Portrait">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Classical Portrait</h3>
                        <p class="price">€5,900</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="room-showcase-container">
            <div class="room-header">
                <span class="shop-tag">shop the look</span>
                <h2>ART NOUVEAU BEDROOM</h2>
                <p>Inspired by the natural world, the Art Nouveau style is defined by its flowing lines, organic forms, and intricate craftsmanship. This bedroom celebrates the elegance of sinuous curves and botanical motifs, creating a serene sanctuary that blurs the line between functional furniture and fine art.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="full-banner-nouveau"></div>
            <div class="product-grid">
                <a href="productpage_6.html" class="product-link">
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/bed.png" alt="Art Nouveau Bed Frame">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Bed Frame</h3>
                        <p class="price">€4,800</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>

                <a href="productpage_2.html" class="product-link">
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/lamp.png" alt="Tiffany Table Lamp">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Tiffany Table Lamp</h3>
                        <p class="price">€2,400</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>

                <a href="productpage_5.html" class="product-link">
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/wardrobe.png" alt="Art Nouveau Wardrobe">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Armoire / Wardrobe</h3>
                        <p class="price">€3,200</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>

                <a href="productpage_3.html" class="product-link">
                <article class="product-card">
                    <figure class="product-image">
                        <img src="src/assets/img/vanity.png" alt="Art Nouveau Dressing Table">
                        <figcaption class="badge">18th Century</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                    <div class="product-info">
                        <h3>Dressing Table</h3>
                        <p class="price">€4,800</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>

</main>


      <!-- @import "footer" -->

</body>
</html>